<title>CHILE: SOCCER-CHILE BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHILE BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile beat Uruguay 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Marcelo Salas (59th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 70,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Colombia     6  4  2  0  12  5 14</p>
<p> Paraguay     5  3  1  1   6  3 10</p>
<p> Ecuador	6  3  0  3   8  7  9</p>
<p> Argentina    5  2  2  1   9  6  8</p>
<p> Chile	  5  2  1  2   8  8  7</p>
<p> Peru	   5  1  3  1   7  7  6</p>
<p> Uruguay	5  2  0  3   4  6  6</p>
<p> Bolivia	5  1  2  2   9  7  5</p>
<p> Venezuela    6  0  1  5   5 19  1</p>
</text>
